Won't there be a list of abbreviations included to clarify their meanings?
If ART is glossed as 'gadri', etc. it won't matter. OTOH, I personally
would try to stay in the language of the article as much as possible. For
Russian, I would use Russian abbreviations, although for German, I would
use the German/French/English ART for 'Artikel/article'. Maybe not the best
example for German, but I would use PL for 'Mehrzahl/pluriel/plural'.

stevo

